   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "It is my last day of this month. I look back at the road. If the system architecture fails, we need a clear plan. I suggest that we check data flow first. The result depends on the project update, so I check it twice. I explain the completed work to a new teammate. I build a full answer around the pattern: This month I learned ... The pattern helps me sound clear and calm: The hardest part was ... I check my notes and confirm the next step.",
   "tts": "It is my last day of this month. I look back at the road. If the system architecture fails, we need a clear plan. I suggest that we check data flow first. The result depends on the project update, so I check it twice. I explain the completed work to a new teammate. I build a full answer around the pattern: This month I learned  The pattern helps me sound clear and calm: The hardest part was  I check my notes and confirm the next step.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "这是这个月的最后一天。我回望走过的路。如果系统架构失败，我们需要一个清晰的方案。我建议我们先检查数据流。结果取决于项目更新，所以我检查了两遍。我向一位新队友解释了已完成工作。我围绕这个句型组织了一个完整的回答：这个月我学会了……这个句型让我听起来清楚又从容：最难的部分是……我检查笔记，确认了下一步。",
