  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I say what I learned and what I will improve. In my update, I use the pattern naturally: I'm proud that ... I teach the pattern to a new teammate: I still need to improve ... The result depends on the interface, so I check it twice. I explain the component to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the current blocker. I document the next action so the team can review it later. The team agrees on the plan, and I record the decision.",
   "tts": "I say what I learned and what I will improve. In my update, I use the pattern naturally: I'm proud that  I teach the pattern to a new teammate: I still need to improve  The result depends on the interface, so I check it twice. I explain the component to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the current blocker. I document the next action so the team can review it later. The team agrees on the plan, and I record the decision.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "我说了自己学到的，还要改进的。在汇报里，我自然地用上了这个句型：我为……感到自豪。我把这个句型教给一位新队友：我仍然需要改进……结果取决于接口，所以我检查了两遍。我向一位新队友解释了组件。我们讨论了当前阻碍相关的风险。我把下一行动写成文档，方便团队之后查看。团队就计划达成一致，我记录了决定。",
