   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. If the lessons learned fails, we need a clear plan. I suggest that we check the follow-up issue first. The result depends on the dependency graph, so I check it twice. I explain the design boundary to a new teammate. I build a full answer around the pattern: Next month I will ... The pattern helps me sound clear and calm: My next small step is ... The project update is clear. Next month, I am ready for more.",
